                <pb facs="0421" n="319" sameAs="frus:frus1927v03/pg319"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/4690: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Eberhardt</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-04-05T16:00:00-05:45"><hi rendition="#italic">April 5, 1927—4
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received April 6—2:20
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>95. Department’s 64, April 4, 1 p.m. I perceive no objection to his visit and
                    welcome opportunity to confer with him.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Eberhardt</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
